[Shuger]|pt|[Shuger]
Outside the safety of the city, there is a pink beast known as ^000077Poring^000000.|pt|Fora da segurança da cidade, existe uma fera rosa conhecida como ^000077Poring^000000.
[Shuger]|pt|[Shuger]
Though it's cute in appearance and does not actively harm people, Poring is known to absorb items that are on the ground into its own body.|pt|Embora tenha uma aparência fofa e não prejudique ativamente as pessoas, Poring é conhecido por absorver itens que estão no chão em seu próprio corpo.
[Shuger]|pt|[Shuger]
So if there's something on the ground that you want to pick up, be careful lest it be consumed by a Poring. Then again... Porings are pretty weak...|pt|Então, se houver algo no chão que você queira pegar, tome cuidado para que não seja consumido por um Poring. 
[Shuger]|pt|[Shuger]
The green colored ^000077Poporing^000000 is tougher than Poring. Newbies generally make the mistake of attacking it without being aware of its power... So be careful!|pt|A cor verde ^000077Poporing^000000 is tougher than Poring. Newbies generally make the mistake of attacking it without being aware of its power... So be careful!
[Tono]|pt|[Tono]
Did you know?|pt|Você sabia?
[Tono]|pt|[Tono]
The larva of Creamy is Fabre. So, those green little wormy things are actually the babies of those pinkish, purply butterfly things you see around.|pt|A larva de Cremoso é Fabre. 
[Tono]|pt|[Tono]
But before Fabres can become Creamys, they go into a pupa stage. When that happens, they turn into these dark purple cocoons we call Pupa. Simple, huh?|pt|Mas antes que Fabres se torne Creamys, eles entram na fase de pupa. 
[Tono]|pt|[Tono]
There's another monster that goes through a really big change... Pickys.|pt|Há outro monstro que passa por uma grande mudança... Pickys.
[Tono]|pt|[Tono]
Pickys are so cute when they're young, but when they grow up, they turn into those big, gawky looking Peco Pecos. Talk about awkward puberty.|pt|Os Pickys são tão fofos quando são jovens, mas quando crescem, eles se transformam naqueles Peco Pecos grandes e desajeitados. 
[Merideth]|pt|[Merideth]
The weather was nice on my day off so my family and I went for a picnic. We chose to go to a slightly secluded area where I saw something really interesting...|pt|O tempo estava bom no meu dia de folga, então minha família e eu fomos fazer um piquenique. 
[Merideth]|pt|[Merideth]
It was a large group of Giant Hornets! What was even weirder was that they were all controlled by this one Queen Bee, following her every command.|pt|Foi um grande grupo de Giant Hornets! 
[Merideth]|pt|[Merideth]
They might just be bugs, but I think they've got the right idea. Men really ought to take commands from us women... We do things right!|pt|Podem ser apenas insetos, mas acho que tiveram a ideia certa. 
