About Heal:About Cure:About Increase AGI:About Angelus:About Blessing:About Warp Portal:End Conversation|pt|Sobre curar:Sobre a cura:Sobre Aumentar AGI:Sobre Angelus:Sobre Bênção:Sobre Portal Warp:Terminar conversa
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
You can recover your own HP with the ^6666CCHeal^000000 skill. Healing is one of the most important ways you can help your friends in battle.|pt|Você pode recuperar seu próprio HP com o ^6666CCHeal^000000 skill. Healing is one of the most important ways you can help your friends in battle.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
Even though our powers are usually used to heal others, you can actually use the ^6666CCHeal^000000 skill to hurt Undead monsters.|pt|Mesmo que nossos poderes sejam normalmente usados ??para curar outras pessoas, você pode realmente usar o ^6666CCHeal^000000 skill to hurt Undead monsters.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
Just remember to hold down the ^6666CCShift^000000 key when you use Cure or Heal on Undead monsters. Just be sure to hurt the monsters though, and don't use it to help monsters.|pt|Apenas lembre-se de manter pressionado ^6666CCShift^000000 key when you use Cure or Heal on Undead monsters. Just be sure to hurt the monsters though, and don't use it to help monsters.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
Later, if you've learned ^6666CCHeal^000000 as an Acolyte, you can learn ^6666CCSanctuary^000000 if you become a Priest.|pt|Mais tarde, se você aprendeu ^6666CCHeal^000000 as an Acolyte, you can learn ^6666CCSanctuary^000000 if you become a Priest.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
Priests use ^6666CCSantuary^000000 to create an area which will restore the HP of you and your friends if you rest within the Sanctuary's area.|pt|Padres usam ^6666CCSantuary^000000 to create an area which will restore the HP of you and your friends if you rest within the Sanctuary's area.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
Once you reach ^6666CCLevel 2 Heal^000000 as an Acolyte, you can learn ^6666CCCure^000000, which can be used to treat abnormal statuses.|pt|Depois de chegar a ^6666CCLevel 2 Heal^000000 as an Acolyte, you can learn ^6666CCCure^000000, which can be used to treat abnormal statuses.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
This skill can be such a life saver, since almost every abnormal status can be cured with the Cure skill. Just remember that you need ^6666CCLevel 2 Heal^000000 before you can learn Cure.|pt|Essa habilidade pode salvar vidas, já que quase todos os status anormais podem ser curados com a habilidade Cure. 
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
Now, the ^6666CCIncrease AGI^000000 skill can be used on you or your friends. For a while your AGI stat is increased, making you attack faster and dodge monster attacks more easily.|pt|Agora, o ^6666CCIncrease AGI^000000 skill can be used on you or your friends. For a while your AGI stat is increased, making you attack faster and dodge monster attacks more easily.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
If you're an Acolyte that wants to learn ^6666CCIncrease AGI^000000, you need to learn ^6666CCLevel 3 Heal^000000 first.|pt|Se você é um Acólito que quer aprender ^6666CCIncrease AGI^000000, you need to learn ^6666CCLevel 3 Heal^000000 first.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
You can use ^6666CCAngelus^000000 to increase your Defense, as well as the Defense of other party members. Remember though, you can only use ^6666CCAngelus^000000 on other people if they are in your party.|pt|Você pode usar ^6666CCAngelus^000000 to increase your Defense, as well as the Defense of other party members. Remember though, you can only use ^6666CCAngelus^000000 on other people if they are in your party.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
Before you can learn Angelus, you will need to have ^6666CCLevel 3 Divine Protection^000000.|pt|Antes de aprender Angelus, você precisará ter ^6666CCLevel 3 Divine Protection^000000.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
Also, if you keep learning Angelus, you'll eventually be able to learn ^6666CCKyrie Eleison^000000. That skill helps you evade initial attacks automatically.|pt|Além disso, se você continuar aprendendo Angelus, eventualmente poderá aprender ^6666CCKyrie Eleison^000000. That skill helps you evade initial attacks automatically.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
^6666CCBlessing^000000 temporarily increases STR, DEX and INT. This skill will give you and your friends a great advantage in battle!|pt|^6666CCBlessing^000000 temporarily increases STR, DEX and INT. This skill will give you and your friends a great advantage in battle!
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
Before you can learn Blessing, you must first learn ^6666CCLevel 5 Divine Protection^000000.|pt|Antes de aprender Bênção, você deve primeiro aprender ^6666CCLevel 5 Divine Protection^000000.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
^6666CCWarp Portal^000000 is a pretty complex skill, and you need to know some other skills before you can learn it.|pt|^6666CCWarp Portal^000000 is a pretty complex skill, and you need to know some other skills before you can learn it.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
First, you need to learn ^6666CCRuwach^000000 which lets you see invisible monsters. After Ruwach, you will need to learn the ^6666CCTeleport^000000 skill.|pt|Primeiro, você precisa aprender ^6666CCRuwach^000000 which lets you see invisible monsters. After Ruwach, you will need to learn the ^6666CCTeleport^000000 skill.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
Once you learn ^6666CCWarp Portal^000000, the level of the Warp Portal skill will determine how many warp destinations, or Warp Points, you can memorize.|pt|Depois de aprender ^6666CCWarp Portal^000000, the level of the Warp Portal skill will determine how many warp destinations, or Warp Points, you can memorize.
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
If you master the Warp Portal skill, you can have a maximum of 4 different Warp Points. But at least one Warp Point is designated as the Save Point that you've made with a Kafra Employee.|pt|Se você dominar a habilidade Warp Portal, poderá ter no máximo 4 Warp Points diferentes. 
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
Well, it's a bit of hassle, but if you want to make a certain place one of your Warp Points, you need to be physically there first. Then, type in ^6666CC/memo^000000 into the command prompt.|pt|Bem, é um pouco complicado, mas se você quiser fazer de um determinado lugar um de seus Warp Points, primeiro você precisa estar fisicamente lá. 
[Garnet]|pt|[Garnet]
