^0000ffLooking incredibly excited, the old man ran into the marine shop hurriedly ordering goods. You don't have anything better to do, so you decide to ask him why he is in such a rush.^000000|pt|^0000ffL parecendo incrivelmente animado, o velho correu para a loja da marinha encomendando mercadorias às pressas. 
