[Mysterious Voice]|pt|[Mysterious Voice]
Welcome to my place, intruders. I've had fun watching you endure all the difficulties I've set before you.|pt|Bem-vindos à minha casa, intrusos. 
[Mysterious Voice]|pt|[Mysterious Voice]
Unfortunately, the time has come to end the show.|pt|Infelizmente, chegou a hora de encerrar o show.
[Mysterious Voice]|pt|[Mysterious Voice]
It's still too early to celebrate your victory against my right-hand man Knothen because he isn't completely destroyed!|pt|Ainda é muito cedo para comemorar sua vitória contra meu braço direito Knothen porque ele não está completamente destruído!
[Mysterious Voice]|pt|[Mysterious Voice]
