[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 A gloomy fortune. How about being cautious? |pt|Uma fortuna sombria. 
 The Marionette uses a lot of money. There is someone around you that is like that, too. |pt|A Marionete gasta muito dinheiro. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 There is a person like that for sure. You should watch out. |pt|Existe uma pessoa assim com certeza. 
 The hair of the Medusa symbolizes the amount of wealth. Seems as something good will happen to you, young one. |pt|O cabelo da Medusa simboliza a quantidade de riqueza. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 You can look forward to it. |pt|Você pode esperar por isso.
 The hair of the Medusa are all snakes. Snakes symbolize greed and slyness. When gathering things, it seems as a cunning force will join you. It's not exactly a bright sign.. |pt|Os cabelos da Medusa são todos de cobras. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 But you surely will get money. Hmm.. |pt|Mas você certamente receberá dinheiro. 
 The Medusa is strongly recommending saving. This card is telling you to save. It says to put many savings accounts in your hair and make yourself resemble its head shape. |pt|A Medusa recomenda fortemente salvar. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 That is what it believes to be wealth. Oooh! |pt|Isso é o que acredita ser riqueza. 
 The Medusa does not enjoy playing with money. you are attempting to use money other than the way it should be used, you should stop. Why? |pt|A Medusa não gosta de brincar com dinheiro. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Because there can be a curse of the Medusa. |pt|Porque pode haver uma maldição da Medusa.
 The great strength of the Baphomet brings in fortune. It seems as you will be able to gather much wealth with the aid of the Baphomet's force! |pt|A grande força do Baphomet traz fortuna. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 It's a good sign! Congratulations! |pt|É um bom sinal! 
 The scythe of the Baphomet means a strong tool to gather wealth. you have a strong tool like his, it should be easy to gather wealth. |pt|A foice do Baphomet significa uma ferramenta forte para acumular riquezas. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 What the Baphomet is trying to say is, find a mean that can help you like his tool. |pt|O que o Baphomet está tentando dizer é: encontre um meio que possa ajudá-lo a gostar de sua ferramenta.
 How about getting involved in raising cattle? It seems like you can gather much wealth through it. |pt|Que tal se envolver na criação de gado? 
 The Baphomet would like a tribute. He is saying that you do, he will return great benefits. |pt|O Baphomet gostaria de uma homenagem. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 So try offering a part of your assets to the Baphomet. |pt|Então experimente oferecer uma parte de seus bens ao Baphomet.
 The Sandman cries with sadness when money comes up. It is sad because money does not possess love or affection. |pt|O Sandman chora de tristeza quando o dinheiro aparece. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 I wonder the meaning of money will slowly disappear from your life as well. |pt|Eu me pergunto que o significado do dinheiro também desaparecerá lentamente da sua vida.
 The Sandman is screaming because it saw too much money. It saw the money in the hands of your future. I wonder what all that money is? |pt|O Sandman está gritando porque viu muito dinheiro. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 I wonder.. Aren't you curious? |pt|Eu me pergunto.. Você não está curioso?
 The Sandman's body is empty inside. Your wallet seems to be emtpy, too. You should save up some money. |pt|O corpo do Sandman está vazio por dentro. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 The Sandman likes to save, too. Even a monster likes to save, but when a human doesn't... |pt|O Sandman também gosta de economizar. 
 Money is like sand. Even you save it, once the wind blows, it disappears. This card shows the emptiness of money. |pt|O dinheiro é como areia. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Indeed, money is futile. |pt|Na verdade, o dinheiro é inútil.
 Sohee is wearing a fine article. To wear something like that, you would need plenty of money. Do you know what the secret is? Sohee saved very much when she was once alive. |pt|Sohee está usando um belo artigo. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 So you should start saving, too. |pt|Portanto, você também deve começar a economizar.
 Sohee hates misers. She believes she has become like that because of a miser. Don't be stingy in front of Sohee! |pt|Sohee odeia avarentos. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 That type of stinginess will spite other people. Use money when it is necessary. |pt|Esse tipo de mesquinhez irá irritar outras pessoas. 
 Sohee dislikes the wealthy. They try to gather money, but never use it for others. you don't want to be cursed by Sohee, you need to learn how to be generous with money. |pt|Sohee não gosta dos ricos. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 So you have malicious desires, forget them. An ill heart easily gathers misfortune. |pt|Então você tem desejos maliciosos, esqueça-os. 
 Sohee likes foreign money. They are cute and pretty. you have foreign currency, Sohee will love you. |pt|Sohee gosta de dinheiro estrangeiro. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Keep an eye out for foreign currency. It will bring you luck. |pt|Fique atento à moeda estrangeira. 
 Those who work hard will gather great fortune. The Skeleton says diligent work will help greatly in gathering wealth. |pt|Aqueles que trabalham duro acumularão grande fortuna. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Hmm~ a ghost is saying strange things. |pt|Hmm~ um fantasma está dizendo coisas estranhas.
 Its youth is gone after a lifetime of chasing after gold. It became a monster with only bones left. No matter how much you like money and your work, look after your life as well. |pt|Sua juventude se foi depois de uma vida inteira perseguindo o ouro. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 There is much more to life than wealth. |pt|A vida é muito mais do que riqueza.
 To become rich, you must work hard as you became a skeleton. The Skeleton is saying to work hard until you become a skeleton. |pt|Para ficar rico, você deve trabalhar duro enquanto se torna um esqueleto. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Then not only the Skeleton, but many people will repay you greatly. |pt|Então, não apenas o Esqueleto, mas muitas pessoas irão retribuir muito.
 The Skeleton says that you can make money by going north. Go north. |pt|O Esqueleto diz que você pode ganhar dinheiro indo para o norte. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 There must be great fortune in that direction. |pt|Deve haver muita sorte nessa direção.
 A knight is a job that requires a lot of money. A hint of a big expense. You might want to tighten your belt. |pt|Um cavaleiro é um trabalho que exige muito dinheiro. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 That is, you don't want go to bankrupt. |pt|Ou seja, você não quer ir à falência.
 Knights do not fight for money. they did, they would be a mercenary. A knight reaches for something higher. What the knight wants to tell you is the way to live. |pt|Os cavaleiros não lutam por dinheiro. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Set a goal higher than money and wealth. Do you understand, young one? |pt|Estabeleça uma meta maior do que dinheiro e riqueza. 
 A knight values honor more than fortune. They consider discussing wealth itself dirty not worthy. How would you be able to ask such a knight a fortune about wealth? |pt|Um cavaleiro valoriza mais a honra do que a fortuna. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 The knight says that a new road of life will open once you look away from fortune. |pt|O cavaleiro diz que um novo caminho de vida se abrirá quando você desviar o olhar da fortuna.
 You need to think of an ideal more noble than money. The fortune the knight suggests is this: Knights never speak of ways to make money. |pt|Você precisa pensar em um ideal mais nobre que o dinheiro. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Compared to life, they believe money is foolish. The knight would like to understand these ideas of life. |pt|Comparado com a vida, eles acreditam que o dinheiro é uma tolice. 
 Working hard is the only way to gather wealth; don't get sidetracked and put effort into working will help your fortune. |pt|Trabalhar duro é a única maneira de acumular riqueza; 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 So do your best. |pt|Então faça o seu melhor.
 What does the god of death have to say about wealth? It is surely a bad omen. It is trying to warn something. |pt|O que o deus da morte tem a dizer sobre a riqueza? 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Be careful. It is the word of the god of death. |pt|Tome cuidado. 
 The Anubis is very interested in the sacrifices offered. The offerings he likes are youth and effort. |pt|O Anúbis está muito interessado nos sacrifícios oferecidos. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 you offer these two things, the Anubis says he will bring you wealth. |pt|você oferece essas duas coisas, o Anúbis diz que lhe trará riqueza.
 The Anubis is giving a warning of the west. There is a being there that can break away your wealth. |pt|O Anúbis está dando um aviso para o oeste. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 you want to protect your assets, beware of the west. |pt|você quer proteger seus bens, cuidado com o Ocidente.
 The Anubis hates those who try to gather money for his death. He believes it's a waste of money. Don't make the mistake of gathering money for death. |pt|O Anúbis odeia aqueles que tentam arrecadar dinheiro para sua morte. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 This is the true advice of a Anubis. |pt|Este é o verdadeiro conselho de um Anúbis.
 The Orc Lord possesses much wealth. It's because of greed. Greed is essential in collecting money. The desire and greediness to make money is not something to be ashamed about. Be diligent and go make money. |pt|O Lorde Orc possui muita riqueza. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 But, too much greed is forbidden. |pt|Mas, muita ganância é proibida.
 The Orc Lord starts drooling about anything involving money. He targets anybody with money. |pt|O Lorde Orc começa a babar sobre qualquer coisa que envolva dinheiro. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Therefore, don't speak of money to the Orc Lord. |pt|Portanto, não fale de dinheiro com o Lorde Orc.
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Same goes for humans. Be wary of those who are avaricious like the Orc Lord. |pt|O mesmo vale para os humanos. 
 There should be great wealth awaiting in the direction the Orc Lord's horn is pointing. The card is directing towards.. |pt|Deveria haver uma grande riqueza aguardando na direção que o chifre do Lorde Orc está apontando. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 The northwest? Would you like to try your luck in that direction? |pt|O noroeste? 
 The Orc Lord likes gold. Of all the treasures, gold is the best. Closely watch gold. |pt|O Lorde Orc gosta de ouro. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Gold is rather peculiar compared to other assets. |pt|O ouro é bastante peculiar em comparação com outros ativos.
 Jack makes money through jokes. Others' happiness is the key to his wealth. |pt|Jack ganha dinheiro com piadas. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Why don't you learn how to make others happy? It should be of great help. |pt|Por que você não aprende como fazer os outros felizes? 
 Jack likes fun money. He detests sad and burdensome money. |pt|Jack gosta de dinheiro virtual. 
 He always says this. Light-hearted and easy money isn't dangerous even it piles up. |pt|Ele sempre diz isso. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 As Jack's advice says, stay closer to light money. It is safer and better. |pt|Como diz o conselho de Jack, fique mais próximo do dinheiro leve. 
 Jack thinks of money as a foolish item. But somehow he makes that kind of money. |pt|Jack pensa no dinheiro como um item tolo. 
 That's why those who are controlled by fools consider the other a fool, too. |pt|É por isso que aqueles que são controlados por tolos consideram o outro tolo também.
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 you don't want to be considered a fool by Jack, don't be controlled by money. |pt|você não quer ser considerado um tolo por Jack, não seja controlado pelo dinheiro.
 Or else, Jack will attack. |pt|Caso contrário, Jack atacará.
 Jack is asking for money. Don't be stingy about paying those who bring entertainment and fun. |pt|Jack está pedindo dinheiro. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Then, Jack will reward you in return. |pt|Então, Jack irá recompensá-lo em troca.
 Do you know what a joker's specialty is? It is tricking others and making money. Be wary of the joker. |pt|Você sabe qual é a especialidade de um curinga? 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Jokers do not exist in one form. They will aim for your money in several different ways. |pt|Os curingas não existem em uma única forma. 
 The Joker says you let him borrow money, he will repay you with more. You're going to refuse, right? But the Joker's temptation does not end after one try. |pt|O Coringa diz que você deixou ele pedir dinheiro emprestado, ele vai te retribuir com mais. 
 He will linger around you as a neighbor, or a rare item and ask for money. |pt|Ele ficará perto de você como um vizinho ou um item raro e pedirá dinheiro.
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Act wisely! You'll be in trouble you are tricked easily! |pt|Aja com sabedoria! 
 Even a joker asks for change, never give any to him. He will ask for change, then end up ask for a big sum of money. |pt|Até um curinga pede troco, nunca dê troco para ele. 
 Jokers are like that. They have the ability to turn a small mistake into a big calamity. |pt|Os curingas são assim. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 That's why you should be more careful about it. |pt|É por isso que você deve ter mais cuidado com isso.
 There is only one reason a Joker requests money.. to take yours. |pt|Há apenas uma razão pela qual um Coringa pede dinheiro... para pegar o seu.
 His goal is not to become rich. A real foul playful one. |pt|Seu objetivo não é ficar rico. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 But losing money isn't a joke now, is it? You should be careful. |pt|Mas perder dinheiro não é brincadeira agora, não é mesmo? 
 Hodes do not know about money. They just gobble everything up. But that might be the shortcut to gaining great wealth. |pt|Hodes não sabe nada sobre dinheiro. 
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Don't focus too much on money. Just work at it. It's saying that it is the best method. |pt|Não se concentre muito no dinheiro. 
 Hodes do not know anything about money. But they do not forgive those who have an eye on their things. |pt|Hodes não sabe nada sobre dinheiro. 
 Not being greedy and taking care of your share is the wisest way to manage your wealth. |pt|Não ser ganancioso e cuidar da sua parte é a maneira mais sábia de administrar seu patrimônio.
[Lhimetorra]|pt|[Lhimetorra]
 Indeed, the Hode is right. Do you understand as well? |pt|Na verdade, o Hode está certo. 
 The Hode knows nothing about money. But a very rare item drops from a Hode's body. |pt|O Hode não sabe nada sobre dinheiro. 
 It has a treasure in it without knowing. |pt|Tem um tesouro sem saber.
