[Gotanblue]|pt|[Gotanblue]
We sailed day and night, drifting for weeks, until one day, we were surrounded by an incredibly thick fog. We had no idea of which direction we were going and the mist wouldn't clear.|pt|Navegamos dia e noite, à deriva durante semanas, até que um dia fomos cercados por uma névoa incrivelmente espessa. 
