[Gotanblue]|pt|[Gotanblue]
By the ^3355FFOne^000000's records, we were able to thoroughly explore all to be seen on Turtle Island. However...|pt|Pelos registros de ^3355FFOne^000000's, pudemos explorar minuciosamente tudo o que pode ser visto na Ilha da Tartaruga. 
[Gotanblue]|pt|[Gotanblue]
