[Gotanblue]|pt|[Gotanblue]
Finally, we packed our things to leave the island. But then, as we were traveling at sea, we encountered a thick, blinding fog once again.|pt|Por fim, arrumamos nossas coisas para sair da ilha. 
[Gotanblue]|pt|[Gotanblue]
We spent a month trying to steer through that mist. When we finally sailed out of that mist, we saw that we had arrived at the other side of Turtle Island!|pt|Passamos um mês tentando navegar através daquela névoa. 
[Gotanblue]|pt|[Gotanblue]
Our spirits were crushed!! We tried again and again to leave that place, and spent nearly a year trying to leave but we kept winding up at Turtle Island's shores.|pt|Nossos espíritos foram esmagados!! 
[Gotanblue]|pt|[Gotanblue]
As we struggled with the fog, we lost our comrades one by one. In the end, Jornadan, the drunken old man you met, and myself were the only ones who were able to return home to Alberta.|pt|Enquanto lutávamos contra a neblina, perdemos nossos camaradas um por um. 
[Gotanblue]|pt|[Gotanblue]
We were the only ones who did not give in to despair, and doggedly held onto our hopes. Still, it was by pure luck that we found a way back to Rune-Midgarts.|pt|Fomos os únicos que não cedemos ao desespero e mantivemos obstinadamente as nossas esperanças. 
