Your mission from here on will be simple, but extremely difficult: you will join the rest of the Continental Guard to keep Satan Morocc from fully reviving its true power.|pt|Sua missão daqui em diante será simples, mas extremamente difícil: você se juntará ao resto da Guarda Continental para impedir que Satan Morocc reviva totalmente seu verdadeiro poder.
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
My soldiers are risking their lives to fight Morocc's doppelgangers and underlings in order to make it safer for their comrades to travel to Morocc's lair.|pt|Meus soldados estão arriscando suas vidas para lutar contra os sósias e subordinados de Marrocos, a fim de tornar mais seguro para seus camaradas viajarem para o covil de Marrocos.
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
It looks like your help could be useful after all. It's time for you to pitch in. Good luck.|pt|Afinal, parece que sua ajuda pode ser útil. 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Umm... Didn't you hear what I said? I said 50 Glacial Hearts, 50.|pt|Hum... Você não ouviu o que eu disse? 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Now hurry up. If you feel like giving up, it's no problem. Let me know, though!|pt|Agora se apresse.
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
I guess you'd benefit from a full situational briefing. Shall I brief you now?|pt|Acho que você se beneficiaria com um briefing situacional completo. 
Yes:No|pt|Sim:Não
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
I'm going to tell you some basic information about fighting Satan Morocc as a member of the Continental Guard.|pt|Vou lhe contar algumas informações básicas sobre como combater Satanás Marrocos como membro da Guarda Continental.
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Do you remember what Morocc was like before this happened? You would if you've been here before.|pt|Você se lembra de como era Marrocos antes de isso acontecer? 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Right now, all of Morocc's entrances and the outer fields leading to other villages are currently under our control.|pt|Neste momento, todas as entradas de Marrocos e os campos exteriores que levam a outras aldeias estão sob o nosso controlo.
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
The main reason for this is because Satan Morocc has been sighted in Sograt Desert, but there's another important reason.|pt|A principal razão para isso é porque Satan Morocc foi avistado no deserto de Sograt, mas há outra razão importante.
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Satan Morocc's power has been causing unnatural gaps in our time-space continuum. The gaps are isolated to this area for now, but we can't be sure if they'll spread.|pt|O poder de Satan Morocc tem causado lacunas não naturais no nosso continuum espaço-tempo. 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Due to the time-space gaps, Sograt Desert's terrain has changed, and some parts of the desert have disappeared.|pt|Devido às lacunas tempo-espaço, o terreno do deserto de Sograt mudou e algumas partes do deserto desapareceram.
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Furthermore, the situation's gotten worse since Satan Morocc's doppelgangers started appearing, and other monsters have become influenced by its power.|pt|Além disso, a situação piorou desde que os sósias de Satan Morocc começaram a aparecer, e outros monstros foram influenciados pelo seu poder.
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
That's all we know so far. If you go out, you'll see what I mean... You may even see horrors that we haven't discovered yet. If you need more information, please speak to the Continental Official.|pt|Isso é tudo que sabemos até agora. 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Please do your best to hold back Satan Morocc. Don't forget that the future of the continent is in our hands. Dismissed.|pt|Por favor, faça o seu melhor para conter Satan Morocc. 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
I see. Keep up your good work in fighting Satan Morocc. Don't forget that the future of the continent is in our hands.|pt|Eu vejo. 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Wah... What? Did you really defeat Satan Morocc?|pt|Uau... O quê? 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
How? Do you have any proof of your victory?|pt|Como? 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
...No, I can't just accept and trust your verbal account. I mean, if you've completed such an important mission, you must bring me some evidence.|pt|...Não, não posso simplesmente aceitar e confiar no seu relato verbal. 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Go back, bring proof of your victory, and then come back.|pt|Volte, traga a prova da sua vitória e depois volte.
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
What? Did you really defeat Satan Morocc?|pt|O que? 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
How? Do you have any proof of your victory?|pt|Como?
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Is... Isn't this?|pt|É... Não é isso?
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Wow... I think this is really the skin of Satan Morocc. Congratulations, soldier. You just saved this world and people from being consumed by destruction and evil.|pt|Nossa... acho que essa é mesmo a pele do Satã Morocc. 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
I guess you seriously wounded Satan Morocc, and it retreated to a time-space gap. No doubt it's trying to recoup its strength.|pt|Eu acho que você feriu seriamente Satan Morocc, e ele recuou para uma lacuna no tempo-espaço. 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
My only regret is that we can't pursue Morocc beyond this dimension. I'm glad, however, that you defeated Satan Morocc and kept it from regaining its full strength. For now, anyway...|pt|Só lamento que não possamos levar Marrocos para além desta dimensão. 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Our researchers might be able to learn some important new facts from this piece of skin... We need to learn all we can about that monster if peace is to be possible in our world's future.|pt|Nossos pesquisadores poderão aprender alguns fatos novos e importantes com esse pedaço de pele... Precisamos aprender tudo o que pudermos sobre esse monstro para que a paz seja possível no futuro do nosso mundo.
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
Once again, I thank you for your distinguished service on behalf of the Continental Guard and the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom. I'll report your great achievement to His Majesty right away.|pt|Mais uma vez, agradeço o seu distinto serviço em nome da Guarda Continental e do Reino de Rune-Midgarts. 
[Chief Balrog]|pt|[Chief Balrog]
