[Eloise McCurdy]|pt|[Eloise McCurdy]
Recently though... Hmpf, my pride has been crushed by those damnable Buffalo Bandits.|pt|Recentemente, porém... Hmpf, meu orgulho foi esmagado por aqueles malditos Bandidos de Búfalo.
[Loading Dock Foreman]|pt|[Loading Dock Foreman]
The train brings ores from the mine, and brings supplies for the miners from this dock.|pt|O trem traz minérios da mina e traz suprimentos para os mineiros deste cais.
[Loading Dock Foreman]|pt|[Loading Dock Foreman]
That's why this place is always busy. A delay here causes a delay everywhere else in Rock Ridge.|pt|É por isso que este lugar está sempre ocupado. 
[Loading Dock Foreman]|pt|[Loading Dock Foreman]
Stop whining like wimps. Be proud to be part of the team and work harder!|pt|Pare de choramingar como fracos. 
[Jader]|pt|[Jader]
Ah, I can't move. I'm aching all over.|pt|Ah, não consigo me mover. 
