[Scrap Metal Collector]|pt|[Scrap Metal Collector]
No. We just have to stay strong until this is over. There'll be an opportunity for us afterward.|pt|Não. Só temos que permanecer fortes até que isto acabe. 
[Scrap Metal Collector]|pt|[Scrap Metal Collector]
