[Scrap Metal Collector]|pt|[Scrap Metal Collector]
Come on, let's be patient for a little longer.|pt|Vamos, vamos ser pacientes um pouco mais.
[Scrap Metal Collector]|pt|[Scrap Metal Collector]
Sigh... I miss my mom.|pt|Suspiro... estou com saudades da minha mãe.
[Scrap Metal Collector]|pt|[Scrap Metal Collector]
Why isn't there any metal here? Some must have dropped when the train was attacked.|pt|Por que não há metal aqui? 
[Scrap Metal Collector]|pt|[Scrap Metal Collector]
