Ehwaz - This rune means the enhancement of luck and positive power. It shapes the source in the form of a red spiral in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Ehwaz – Esta runa significa o aumento da sorte e do poder positivo. 
Osilia - This rune is an equivalent exchange which means that you lose one and you gain one, and it also means the power that needs a cost. This is shaped into the form of a violet oblique line in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Osilia - Esta runa é uma troca equivalente, o que significa que você perde uma e ganha outra, e também significa o poder que precisa de um custo. 
Mannaz - This rune means hope and a new start and also the positive power that can reverse a desperate situation. This is shaped into the form of an emerald diamond in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Mannaz – Esta runa significa esperança e um novo começo e também o poder positivo que pode reverter uma situação desesperadora. 
Ansuz - This rune means preparation or arrangement and the power that can overcome the uneasiness of the coming future. This is shaped into the form of an emerald round in a Rune Furnace. |pt|Ansuz – Esta runa significa preparação ou arranjo e o poder que pode superar a inquietação do futuro próximo. 
Hagalas - This rune means the freedom and the power that resists restraint. This is shaped into the form of a sky-blue colored star-shape in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Hagalas – Esta runa significa a liberdade e o poder que resiste à restrição. 
Kano - This rune means flame and passion, and the power that ends everything. The source of it is shaped into the form of a red diamond in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Kano – Esta runa significa chama e paixão, e o poder que acaba com tudo. 
Rhydo - This rune means the combination and recombination and the power of completion. This is shaped into the sky-blue oblique line in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Rhydo – Esta runa significa a combinação e recombinação e o poder de conclusão. 
Turisus - This rune means the border and the power of limitation. This is shaped into a yellow round in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Turisus – Esta runa significa a fronteira e o poder da limitação. 
Dagaz - This rune means the talent and the power of enduring adversity. This is shaped into an emerald spiral in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Dagaz – Esta runa significa o talento e o poder de suportar adversidades. 
Sowilo - This rune means victory and success and the power of arrangement and cessation. This is shaped into the form of a sky-blue fan-shape in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Sowilo – Esta runa significa vitória e sucesso e o poder de arranjo e cessação. 
Laguz -This rune means uncertainty and the power that protects the inside. This is shaped into a form of a yellow diamond in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Laguz –Esta runa significa incerteza e o poder que protege o interior. 
Isia - This rune means the power that stops everything. This is shaped into a violet spiral in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Isia – Esta runa significa o poder que para tudo. 
Pertz - This rune means revelation and the power of chance. This is shaped into the form of silver spiral in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Pertz – Esta runa significa revelação e o poder do acaso. 
Verkana - This rune means richness, birth and the power of defense and protection. This is shaped into the form of a gold-color star in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Verkana – Esta runa significa riqueza, nascimento e poder de defesa e proteção. 
Gebo - This rune means cooperation and the power of harmony. This is shaped into the form of a yellow cone in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Gebo – Esta runa significa cooperação e o poder da harmonia. 
Algiz - This rune means chance and the power of challenge. This is shaped into the form of an emerald oblique line in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Algiz – Esta runa significa acaso e o poder do desafio. 
Arwez - This rune means change, convulsion and the power of movement. This is shaped into the form of a gray diamond in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Arwez – Esta runa significa mudança, convulsão e poder de movimento. 
Teiwaz - This rune means perfect victory and the power of absolute solution. This is shaped into the form of a gold round in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Teiwaz – Esta runa significa vitória perfeita e o poder da solução absoluta. 
Wunjo - This rune means intelligence and the power of wisdom. This is shaped into the form of an emerald star in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Wunjo – Esta runa significa inteligência e o poder da sabedoria. 
Jera - This rune means comfort and the power of rest. This is shaped into the form of a yellow round in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Jera – Esta runa significa conforto e poder de descanso. 
Nosiege - This rune means weakness and the power of attenuating. This is shaped into the form of a yellow fan-shape in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Nosiege – Esta runa significa fraqueza e poder de atenuação. 
Ingz - This rune means disruption and the power of separation. This is shaped into the form of a violet diamond in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Ingz – Esta runa significa ruptura e o poder da separação. 
Fehu - This rune means attainment and the power of materialization. This is shaped into the form of a silver round in a Rune Furnace.|pt|Fehu – Esta runa significa realização e poder de materialização. 
