[Lazy]|pt|[Lazy]
There's nothing that says intruder on the face of this Criminal Scientist.|pt|Não há nada que diga intruso no rosto deste Cientista Criminal.
[Seihyu]|pt|[Seihyu]
We can't distinguish. It's just data collection. Every word you say and actions are datas that we collect.|pt|Não conseguimos distinguir. 
[Seihyu]|pt|[Seihyu]
And we compare it to produce the best result. Then we exclude out the intruders, this is course of action from Alpha.|pt|E nós comparamos para produzir o melhor resultado. 
[Seihyu]|pt|[Seihyu]
I want to ask. Why are you trying to save that person?|pt|Eu quero perguntar. 
Isn't she a person who've harmed you too?|pt|Ela não é uma pessoa que te machucou também?
[Seihyu]|pt|[Seihyu]
Is it because you still have a need for it?|pt|É porque você ainda precisa disso?
