[Mass Charleston]|pt|[Mass Charleston]
she would say she doesn't have the heart or brain to remember or know. I wonder if she knows|pt|ela diria que não tem coração ou cérebro para lembrar ou saber. 
[Mass Charleston]|pt|[Mass Charleston]
that the memories of Humans fade and get distorted or glorified with time.|pt|que as memórias dos Humanos desaparecem e são distorcidas ou glorificadas com o tempo.
[Mass Charleston]|pt|[Mass Charleston]
