Please keep the Hunter Desert Wolves away from my strings. Catch ten wolves and they won't go after my strings anymore.|pt|Por favor, mantenha os Hunter Desert Wolves longe das minhas cordas. 
[Chef]|pt|[Chef]
You may come to me when you're done, or you may report to <NAVI>^4D4DFF[Fisher]^000000<INFO>lasa_fild02,326,170,000,1,</INFO></NAVI> who is drying fish in Raviol Forest.|pt|Você pode vir até mim quando terminar ou pode reportar-se a <NAVI>^4D4DFF[Fisher]^000000<INFO>lasa_fild02,326,170,000,1,</INFO></NAVI> que está secando peixe na Floresta Raviol.
[Chef]|pt|[Chef]
Good. An order for fish cake just came in.|pt|Bom. 
[Chef]|pt|[Chef]
We didn't get orders for this menu that often, so It's strange that there's so many requests. Did the word spread finally that It's good?|pt|Não recebíamos pedidos para esse menu com tanta frequência, então é estranho que haja tantos pedidos. 
[Chef]|pt|[Chef]
Anyhow, we're in a hurry down to the minute and seconds but that sleepyhead is probably sleeping again. So I hope that you, adventurer, can help us again.|pt|De qualquer forma, estamos com pressa até os minutos e segundos, mas aquele dorminhoco provavelmente está dormindo de novo. 
[Chef]|pt|[Chef]
Please bring five mushroom spores and catch ten Trans Spores.|pt|Por favor, traga cinco esporos de cogumelos e pegue dez Trans Spores.
[Chef]|pt|[Chef]
You may come to me when you're done, or you may report to <NAVI>^4D4DFF[Sleepy meow]^000000<INFO>lasa_fild02,331,251,000,1,</INFO></NAVI> who is dozing off in the forest.|pt|Você pode vir até mim quando terminar ou pode reportar-se a <NAVI>^4D4DFF[Sleepy miau]^000000<INFO>lasa_fild02,331,251,000,1,</INFO></NAVI> que está cochilando na floresta.
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Today won't be boring? I wonder who'll visit me today. Who is it?|pt|Hoje não vai ser chato? 
[|pt|[[
Is anybody here?|pt|Tem alguém aqui?
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Ah! You're here. Come in. This is a magical place of miraculous elderly lady. It's a shrine.|pt|Ah! 
[|pt|[[
Elderly lady? She doesn't look like one. Like a very... young doram.|pt|Senhora idosa? 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Not me!|pt|Eu não!
[|pt|[[
Who else?|pt|Quem mais?
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Grandma will be sad to hear that. This world is full of things that exist but cannot be seen. For instance, Let's talk about your case.|pt|A vovó ficará triste ao ouvir isso. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Before the discovery of the new world, we dorams thought that Lasagna was the end of the world. The new world was invisible and so were the countless people who lived there.|pt|Antes da descoberta do novo mundo, nós, dorams, pensávamos que a lasanha era o fim do mundo. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
But didn't the new world and human really exist?|pt|Mas o novo mundo e o novo ser humano não existiam realmente?
[|pt|[[
I get what you're saying.|pt|Eu entendo o que você está dizendo.
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
So what brings you here?|pt|Então, o que traz você aqui?
[|pt|[[
There is a sufferer and I'm here for that person.|pt|Há um sofredor e estou aqui por essa pessoa.
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
What pain is that? If grandma and I can take care of it, we will. One shouldn't turn away from a sufferer.|pt|Que dor é essa? 
[|pt|[[
Well, he's in denial but I think he's been possessed by an evil spirit. He opened a sealed jar on an uninhabited island.|pt|Bem, ele está em negação, mas acho que foi possuído por um espírito maligno. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Oh my. Who would've thought that there would be another idiot like the ^0000cdboatswain of Con-Chliina^000000.|pt|Oh meu Deus. 
[|pt|[[
Uh, that boatswain is the person who had asked for my help.|pt|Uh, aquele contramestre é a pessoa que pediu minha ajuda.
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Indeed, who else would do such an idiotic thing? I can't help him, so please leave.|pt|Na verdade, quem mais faria uma coisa tão idiota? 
[|pt|[[
Is there really no way to help him?|pt|Não há realmente nenhuma maneira de ajudá-lo?
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Those evil spirits usually try to take over the host by absorbing his energy and leave when he dies. For some reason, they can't take over the host's body.|pt|Esses espíritos malignos geralmente tentam dominar o hospedeiro absorvendo sua energia e vão embora quando ele morre. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
So they move on to another person nearby. That's why when the host dies, it is specially sealed in a jar by a shaman and discarded in a place where no one can find it.|pt|Então eles passam para outra pessoa próxima. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
But if someone opens the jar, those evil spirits cling onto that idiot and repeat the same process. there's no way to detach them until the host dies. In other words, there's no solution that would make the boatswain happy.|pt|Mas se alguém abre a jarra, esses espíritos malignos se agarram àquele idiota e repetem o mesmo processo. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
When I told him that ¡°a noble person from a new place solves the problem,¡± I meant that the problem will move onto ^0000cda new person^000000. Seems like he misunderstood me and sent you.|pt|Quando eu disse a ele que ¡° uma pessoa nobre de um novo lugar resolve o problema, ¡± eu quis dizer que o problema passará para ^0000cda nova pessoa^000000. Parece que ele me entendeu mal e enviou você.
[|pt|[[
T-then, you've also...|pt|E-então, você também...
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
I opened the jar. It was an unfortunate accident.|pt|Abri o pote. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
I-I don't mean that I dislike grandma. Yes, yes. I'll be careful.|pt|E-eu não quero dizer que não gosto da vovó. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Anyway, the boatswain has no choice. Live rest of his life, tormented, or become a shaman cat and live somewhat comfortably. Life of a shaman cat Isn't so bad.|pt|De qualquer forma, o contramestre não tem escolha. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Those with much knowledge have a bit more options.|pt|Quem tem muito conhecimento tem um pouco mais de opções.
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
If he chooses not to become a shaman meow, then he must live every day ^0000cddependent on a new talisman^000000. But if he chooses to become a shaman meow, then tell him to come see me.|pt|Se ele escolher não se tornar um miau xamã, então ele deverá viver todos os dias ^0000cdddependente de um novo talismã^000000.. Mas se ele escolher se tornar um miau xamã, então diga-lhe para vir me ver.
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
But becoming a shaman meow will be better in many ways. Evil spirits will wear him down more and more to take over his body.|pt|Mas tornar-se um miau xamã será melhor em muitos aspectos. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
I heard that the boatswain had visited previous shaman meow with Captain Gamberry in the past. But he stormed out in the middle of explanation and never came back.|pt|Ouvi dizer que o contramestre já havia visitado o miado xamã anterior com o capitão Gambberry no passado. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
He should be counting his days by now after suffering so much.|pt|Ele já deveria estar contando seus dias depois de sofrer tanto.
[|pt|[[
Not really. He seemed really energetic.|pt|Na verdade. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
I guess not everyone has what it takes to become the boatswain of Con-Chliina. How did he survive all this time?|pt|Acho que nem todo mundo tem o que é preciso para se tornar o contramestre de Con-Chliina. 
[|pt|[[
Well... He seems to be living off on one superstition to another. Like dolls and salts.|pt|Bem... Ele parece estar vivendo de uma superstição para outra. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Oh my, he really is an idiot. Had he come to me earlier, I would have told him about a less painful path.|pt|Nossa, ele é realmente um idiota. 
[|pt|[[
At any rate, if he must depend on a new talisman every day, what's today's talisman? I'm sure the boatswain needs some time to think things over, so until then, he'll need talisman.|pt|De qualquer forma, se ele precisa depender de um novo talismã todos os dias, qual é o talismã de hoje? 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Today's talisman... Let me see.|pt|O talismã de hoje... Deixe-me ver.
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Oh, that? Really? Ooh, That's awful... Seriously, how would that...ugh.|pt|Ah, isso? 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Today's talisman is ^0000cd20 basils and 5 basil locks^000000. Tie them firmly and carry them around. Then he'll be safe today.|pt|O talismã de hoje é ^0000cd20 manjericões e 5 mechas de manjericão^000000. Amarre-os firmemente e carregue-os consigo. 
[|pt|[[
Basil and basil lock?|pt|Bloqueio de manjericão e manjericão?
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
They both are obtained from those dirty ^0000cdbasilisks^000000. Basilisks received energy from Lord Imuk that lived over 2,000 years, so evil spirits can't stand even being near a piece of them.|pt|Ambos são obtidos daqueles ^0000cdbasilisks^000000. sujos. Os basiliscos receberam energia de Lord Imuk que viveu mais de 2.000 anos, então os espíritos malignos não suportam nem mesmo estar perto de um pedaço deles.
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
But they really are way too filthy. I bet the boatswain will ask you for a favor since he won't want to catch one with his own hands.|pt|Mas eles realmente são muito imundos. 
[|pt|[[
Sure. I'll tell him.|pt|Claro. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Then see you again soon.|pt|Então nos vemos novamente em breve.
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Make sure you deliver my message to the boatswain. And today's talisman is 20 basils and 5 basil locks.|pt|Certifique-se de entregar minha mensagem ao contramestre. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
Today's talisman is ^0000cd5 basil locks and 1 holy water^000000. In the new world, the holy water drives the evil spirits away. It must've worked when the boatswain came in contact with the people of the new world.|pt|O talismã de hoje é ^0000cd5 cadeados de manjericão e 1 água benta^000000. No novo mundo, a água benta afasta os espíritos malignos. 
Today's talisman is ^0000cd20 basil locks^000000. You'll get your hands very dirty today. I'm sorry. But grandma has spoken so That's the bottom line.|pt|O talismã de hoje é ^0000cd20 mechas de manjericão^000000.. Você vai sujar muito as mãos hoje. 
[Shaman meow]|pt|[Shaman meow]
