Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
The long-awaited first voyage. After unloading everything, I hope we return as full ship again...|pt|A tão esperada primeira viagem. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Business is good everywhere we go. I'm amazed by the insight of Captain Peperoncino and his crewmen.|pt|Os negócios vão bem onde quer que vamos. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Three days since we left Port Richoli. Met a storm. It's not the first time we experienced the fickleness of mother nature, but we can't help but feel dejected when counting the losses.|pt|Três dias desde que saímos de Port Richoli. 
Seriously wounded 1, mildly wounded 13, top quality anchovies 23 boxes, kaluna 7 jars, beard comb 1 box, fine fabric 200 rolls.|pt|Gravemente 1 ferido, levemente ferido 13, anchovas de primeira qualidade 23 caixas, kaluna 7 potes, pente para barba 1 caixa, tecido fino 200 rolos.
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
A couple days ago we met a storm, but another one?! Who set the course this way at this time of the year? I guess I should let it go since It's the first time.|pt|Há alguns dias encontramos uma tempestade, mas outra?! 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Nothing is up. Quiet. A shoal of flying fish over the ocean cast with full moon is just spectacular to watch.|pt|Nada está acontecendo. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
It's great to empty out all the cargo and return with new items loaded. I feel proud, It's like the feeling you get from gleaning and dispersing the crops widely.|pt|É ótimo esvaziar toda a carga e voltar com novos itens carregados. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
A glass kaluna milk at a pub after receiving my paycheck is the sweetest thing in the world.|pt|Um copo de leite kaluna em um pub depois de receber meu salário é a coisa mais doce do mundo.
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Captain Gamberry and Captain Thomas are weird. They try to keep the lead in a straight line and sail on same speed. It's like having kids walk in steps.|pt|Capitão Gambberry e Capitão Thomas são estranhos. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
We run into storms so often that I'm wondering if we should change our course. Thank god we avoided the storm in Port Richoli.|pt|Enfrentamos tempestades com tanta frequência que me pergunto se deveríamos mudar nosso curso. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
The sous chef we recruited from Port Richoli is just fantastic.|pt|O sous chef que recrutamos em Port Richoli é simplesmente fantástico.
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
We lost Butterfly to the storm we met on the second day we left Port Richoli. We were so devastated that no one was able to say anything when we returned to Lasagna.|pt|Perdemos Butterfly na tempestade que encontramos no segundo dia em que saímos de Port Richoli. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
No sailing for a while.|pt|Nada de velejar por um tempo.
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
It feels like everyone will be back and smiling if I go to the port.|pt|Parece que todos voltarão e sorrirão se eu for ao porto.
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
No news still.|pt|Ainda não há notícias.
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
A search for Butterfly, second time. Nothing. We couldn't find any remnants of Butterfly. So they must be safe.|pt|Uma busca por Butterfly, pela segunda vez. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Still no news on Butterfly.|pt|Ainda não há notícias sobre Butterfly.
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Helmsman caught tuna by fishing. Chef tried to steam the whole fish but the sous chef barely stopped him and cut into pieces for everyone. I wish I can have some more.|pt|Timoneiro pegou atum pescando. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Tuna is served again. First day was tuna, second day was tuna pasta, third day was fried tuna, fourth day was braised tuna... I'm sick of it. Just had it. Did we do something to anger the sous chef?|pt|O atum é servido novamente. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Boatswain tried to throw out the remaining tuna and got caught by the sous chef. We all learned how scary he can be.|pt|O contramestre tentou jogar fora o atum restante e foi pego pelo sous chef. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
We met a storm. Everyone was well-prepared, so the damage was not huge. I guess this is what a know-how is.|pt|Encontramos uma tempestade. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Boatswain is acting strangely. We barely stopped him from trying to jump into water in the middle of a night. He seems to have lost it when I see him shivering all over, but then he's fine the next morning. He's bewitched or something.|pt|O contramestre está agindo de forma estranha. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Still searching. No news on Butterfly.|pt|Ainda procurando. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
We never had any rats but all of a sudden the ship is infested. Upon investigation, the boatswain... you're such a...|pt|Nunca tivemos ratos, mas de repente o navio está infestado. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
A year may pass but we cannot give up the search. We're combing through the area where we lost them.|pt|Pode passar um ano mas não podemos desistir da busca. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
I don't know why, but I don't like the feel of this.|pt|Não sei por que, mas não gosto da sensação disso.
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Storm. So sick of storms. We're so used to it that we can practically ride over it.|pt|Tempestade. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
You turned our ship because Stello claimed to have seen something strange last night. It's a route that we've never seen before. Everyone had different opinions, but since we had looked everywhere we can, we decided to give it a try.|pt|Você virou nosso navio porque Stello afirmou ter visto algo estranho ontem à noite. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
I had a strange dream.|pt|Eu tive um sonho estranho.
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
When we went through the dense fog that appeared suddenly, there was an island we had never seen before. There were the Butterfly crewmen, their presence natural like the natives.|pt|Quando passamos pela densa neblina que apareceu de repente, havia uma ilha que nunca tínhamos visto antes. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Where we had landed softly after being hit by huge waves is called the Soft Island. This is a mysterious place inhabited by people with different appearances. It's a discovery of a new world.|pt|O local onde pousamos suavemente após sermos atingidos por ondas enormes é chamado de Ilha Suave. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Using Soft Island as the base, Butterfly already had a footing in the new world and was making profits. They are just born to be merchants.|pt|Usando Soft Island como base, Butterfly já tinha uma posição no novo mundo e estava lucrando. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
We are on our way to Lasagna. Captain Gamberry and Captain Thomas had a long conversation.|pt|Estamos a caminho da lasanha. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Arrived in Lasagna. Drank five glasses of kaluna milk.|pt|Chegou em lasanha. 
3 years ago: decided to set sail|pt|Há 3 anos: decidi zarpar
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
We are heading to the new world loaded with supplies. I wanted to take a close look and this is a great opportunity.|pt|Estamos indo para o novo mundo carregados de suprimentos. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Storm again.|pt|Tempestade novamente.
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Arrived in Soft Island. I don't know how we found the way in the vast open sea, but It's still amazing.|pt|Chegou na Ilha Suave. 
Month X Day X|pt|Mês X Dia X
Captain Gamberry and Captain Thomas officially announced their expansion plan to the new world. Con-Chliina will be in charge of recruiting and sending adventurers to the new world|pt|Capitão Gambberry e Capitão Thomas anunciaram oficialmente seu plano de expansão para o novo mundo. 
