[Suad]|pt|[Suad]
Don't worry about this side. Just make sure to prepare a proper board.|pt|Não se preocupe com esse lado. 
[Niren]|pt|[Niren]
Thank you. You've grown well...|pt|Obrigado. 
[Elly]|pt|[Elly]
Alright. The situation in this country is actually beyond my knowledge, but it seems to have been resolved well.|pt|Tudo bem. 
