[Ezekiel]|pt|[Ezekiel]
Wow, thank you so much!|pt|Uau, muito obrigado!
[Ezekiel]|pt|[Ezekiel]
I would need 1 Steel and 10 Very Unusual Crystal, and the Very Unusual Crystal can be obtained from the Gray Wolf.|pt|Eu precisaria de 1 Aço e 10 Cristais Muito Incomuns, e o Cristal Muito Incomum pode ser obtido no Lobo Cinzento.
I'll wait!|pt|Vou esperar!
[Ezekiel]|pt|[Ezekiel]
Thank you, Adventurer, for your efforts. Uh... but we're a little low on quantity, did you forget...?|pt|Obrigado, aventureiro, por seus esforços. 
[Ezekiel]|pt|[Ezekiel]
I would need 1 Steel and 10 Very Unusual Crystal, and the Very Unusual Crystal can be obtained from the Gray Wolf.|pt|Eu precisaria de 1 Aço e 10 Cristais Muito Incomuns, e o Cristal Muito Incomum pode ser obtido no Lobo Cinzento.
[Ezekiel]|pt|[Ezekiel]
Adventurer, you've worked hard. I'm always grateful. I'll take a break today and see you again after dawn!|pt|Aventureiro, você trabalhou duro. 
