[Old Man]|pt|[Old Man]
Whether it's the same as ours or not, it's always nice to have one more neighbor to talk to. Who doesn't love a friendly neighbor?|pt|Seja igual ao nosso ou não, é sempre bom ter mais um vizinho para conversar. 
I...|pt|EU...
[Old Man]|pt|[Old Man]
Who are you? I don't recognize you.|pt|Quem é você? 
[Old Man]|pt|[Old Man]
