[Old Man]|pt|[Old Man]
Well, it hasn't been lacking, because if it had, we wouldn't have survived here for as long as we have.|pt|Bem, não faltou, porque se tivesse, não teríamos sobrevivido aqui por tanto tempo.
[Old Man]|pt|[Old Man]
