[Belle]|pt|[Belle]
The ^4d4dffladies of the Nerius family have just asked to see you in the Banquet Hall^000000 .|pt|As ^4d4dffladies da família Nerius acabaram de pedir para vê-lo no Banquet Hall^000000 .
