[Wolf]|pt|[Wolf]
I want him to visit us more than to help me.|pt|Quero que ele nos visite mais do que me ajude.
[|pt|[[
Ah, he also said he would come after the banquet is finished.|pt|Ah, ele também disse que viria depois que o banquete terminasse.
[Wolf]|pt|[Wolf]
Well I am happy that our relationship will improve.|pt|Bem, estou feliz que nosso relacionamento vai melhorar.
[Wolf]|pt|[Wolf]
Once, we were the closest friends, but the relationship became awkward after he left the family.|pt|Antigamente éramos amigos mais próximos, mas o relacionamento ficou estranho depois que ele deixou a família.
[Wolf]|pt|[Wolf]
Anyway, I think we have to make preparation to welcome him seriously.|pt|De qualquer forma, acho que temos que nos preparar para recebê-lo com seriedade.
[Maximilian]|pt|[Maximilian]
I am glad that now everything has found its place. I have been worried a lot.|pt|Estou feliz que agora tudo encontrou o seu lugar. 
[Maximilian]|pt|[Maximilian]
All theses things are thanks to you. I feel safe now that everyone has their right places and will work hard for the family and country.|pt|Todas essas coisas são graças a você. 
[Wolf]|pt|[Wolf]
Dear adventurer. Thank you very much for helping my family. I have been thinking how I can reward you for your contribution, but cannot find anything that is comparable to the magnitude of thank.|pt|Caro aventureiro. 
[Wolf]|pt|[Wolf]
However at least to express my mind, I have prepare a small present. Please take it.|pt|Porém, pelo menos para expressar o que penso, preparei um pequeno presente. 
[Maximilian]|pt|[Maximilian]
If you need a help from the Roegenburg, come to use anytime. The gate of the Roegenburg is always opened to you.|pt|Se precisar da ajuda do Roegenburg, venha usar a qualquer hora. 
[Maximilian]|pt|[Maximilian]
Dear adventurer, welcome.|pt|Caro aventureiro, seja bem-vindo.
