[Shorty]|pt|[Shorty]
^0000cdMidgard Continent^000000 is said to have the greatest influence of the three kingdoms of Arunafelts, Schwaldzwald, and Rune-Midgarts. Each continent has an airship you can readily use.|pt|Diz-se que ^0000cdMidgard Continent^000000  tem a maior influência dos três reinos de Arunafelts, Schwaldzwald e Rune-Midgarts. 
[Shorty]|pt|[Shorty]
