[Shorty]|pt|[Shorty]
^0000cdArunafelz^000000. This is a church that worships a goddess. So, there is a Pope. Of course, you can't meet anyone, but is it possible? Maybe we can meet at least once.|pt|^0000cdArunafelz^000000. Esta é uma igreja que adora uma deusa. 
[Shorty]|pt|[Shorty]
