[Shorty]|pt|[Shorty]
Many people thought that there was only the continent of Midgard on this land, but one day, people appeared in the form of ^0000cdcats^000000. No one knew where they came from.|pt|Muitas pessoas pensavam que só existia o continente de Midgard nesta terra, mas um dia, pessoas apareceram na forma de ^0000cdcats^000000. Ninguém sabia de onde elas vieram.
